                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Needs pause and construct option. It's okay in the first few levels but just becomes tedious and unplayable to have to go through each level multiple times and try to memorize what you need. Hot bar option might be a workable in between option where you can setup the structures you want before starting, but don't know on later levels if that would be enough. As is, it's a fun strategy game hiding behind a bad puzzle game. That said, having picked it up for under $1 I can recommend it",
